WEBVTT

00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:17.000
I know this cold voice

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:21.300
Taking my friend

00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:27.000
Maybe a little afraid you'll run away

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:29.920
But right now...

00:00:29.920 --> 00:00:35.000
For this moment in time, I want to hold you tight

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:40.140
By your side, I'm dreaming of the days

00:00:40.140 --> 00:00:45.000
When I finally look up at the promised sky

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:49.000
I'll take off and break all the way

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:53.000
For this moment in time, I just wanna be with you

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:58.200
By your side, I'm dreaming of the days

00:00:58.200 --> 00:01:02.750
When I finally look up at the promised sky

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:07.000
I know I can change all the way

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:11.000
For the moment...

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:20.300
I just wanna hold you...

00:01:30.900 --> 00:01:35.900
"Feelings That Don't Reach"

00:01:39.100 --> 00:01:41.800
You're Lee-Leng Huang.

00:01:45.200 --> 00:01:48.000
The esteemed head of the Huang Group...

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:51.000
and you moonlight as a bodyguard?

00:01:51.300 --> 00:01:56.000
You're too big. I'll have to consult my superiors.

00:01:56.000 --> 00:01:59.000
That--that much of a big shot?

00:01:59.250 --> 00:02:01.800
Brian. Shut your mouth.

00:02:01.800 --> 00:02:03.000
Sorry, Boss.

00:02:03.350 --> 00:02:07.000
B--Boss, call an ambulance!

00:02:07.450 --> 00:02:09.190
Th--the blood won't stop!

00:02:09.190 --> 00:02:12.000
Later.

00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:15.000
If your complaining screws this up,

00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:17.000
you're a dead man either way.

00:02:17.500 --> 00:02:19.000
Stop the bleeding!

00:02:19.300 --> 00:02:23.000
Brian, do something about the body.

00:02:23.000 --> 00:02:23.950
Right.

00:02:23.950 --> 00:02:26.200
Ernest...

00:02:26.200 --> 00:02:27.960
Not much of a bodyguard.

00:02:28.050 --> 00:02:30.080
But you have other problems.

00:02:30.880 --> 00:02:35.300
You and I are going to spend a little time together.

00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:40.180
Stop it! He's hurt. There's no need to tie him up.

00:02:49.050 --> 00:02:53.300
If you were just a spoiled rich kid I wouldn't need to get rough.

00:02:54.000 --> 00:02:58.000
Hm! Geez. Well, nothing I can do now.

00:02:58.350 --> 00:03:03.300
After I hand over the Prince, you'll go home.

00:03:04.800 --> 00:03:09.000
For a price, of course.

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:11.000
Ransom?

00:03:11.350 --> 00:03:16.000
I thought you'd be smarter than that.

00:03:16.250 --> 00:03:19.000
It never pays off in the end.

00:03:19.150 --> 00:03:22.000
Hmph. Even his tongue is smooth.

00:03:22.000 --> 00:03:26.000
Haven't you realized, unless you do something stupid,

00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:29.000
you could get the money straight from me?

00:03:29.700 --> 00:03:31.300
What?

00:03:32.600 --> 00:03:37.400
I'll pay my own ransom.

00:03:43.300 --> 00:03:48.000
Hm. What the hell? It's not the same thing.

00:03:48.200 --> 00:03:50.000
You don't get it.

00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:55.000
If the company pays you, this is a crime.

00:03:55.000 --> 00:04:00.000
If I pay you, it's a donation.

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:04.300
You'd actually get to spend that money.

00:04:08.350 --> 00:04:12.000
Conveniently, I'm the head of the family.

00:04:12.300 --> 00:04:17.300
All money matters are up to me.

00:04:18.400 --> 00:04:21.070
You can name your price!

00:04:21.070 --> 00:04:27.000
Hah! Pathetic. I can see right through you.

00:04:27.000 --> 00:04:31.500
A hundred million bucks? How about that, huh?

00:04:31.890 --> 00:04:35.080
Agreed. It's a deal.

00:04:43.100 --> 00:04:50.000
Hmph. You're just trying to stall for time, aren't you? I won't fall for it.

00:04:50.250 --> 00:04:54.000
Another 200 million. For the Prince.

00:04:54.000 --> 00:04:56.850
That makes 300 million dollars.

00:04:58.200 --> 00:05:05.250
Say yes, and in a few hours you'll both be set for life.

00:05:05.600 --> 00:05:08.000
Or keep trying to earn a living this way,

00:05:08.000 --> 00:05:12.300
as stooges in a tiny country's family feuds.

00:05:12.800 --> 00:05:16.120
B--Boss. Boss!

00:05:19.800 --> 00:05:24.300
An interesting talk.

00:05:24.800 --> 00:05:29.000
But stupid, and I don't have time to play along.

00:05:29.000 --> 00:05:31.000
It's almost time for the pickup.

00:05:31.000 --> 00:05:33.300
Brian! Guard them.

00:05:33.800 --> 00:05:35.300
Yes, sir.

00:05:41.800 --> 00:05:43.300
Lee-Leng!

00:05:48.800 --> 00:05:51.300
He was serious. 300 million...

00:05:53.550 --> 00:05:55.000
Does it hurt?

00:05:55.000 --> 00:05:57.000
I'm fine.

00:05:57.000 --> 00:06:00.000
I've planted a seed of doubt.

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:03.000
Their hesitation will be our only chance.

00:06:03.000 --> 00:06:04.170
Prince.

00:06:04.950 --> 00:06:08.300
When I give the signal, dive into the water.

00:06:10.350 --> 00:06:13.300
Just for now, do as I say.

00:06:15.400 --> 00:06:17.300
Lee-Leng...

00:06:18.650 --> 00:06:23.070
Those big eyes... the color called orient blue...

00:06:23.070 --> 00:06:26.000
If they were silver...

00:06:26.000 --> 00:06:29.000
they could be Kajika's.

00:06:29.200 --> 00:06:33.300
I had never seen it before,

00:06:34.400 --> 00:06:37.000
but it's incredible, his resemblance...

00:06:37.550 --> 00:06:40.300
to my Kajika.

00:06:47.200 --> 00:06:49.220
Lee-Leng...

00:07:02.250 --> 00:07:04.230
Awake already?

00:07:08.000 --> 00:07:10.300
Kajika?

00:07:10.850 --> 00:07:13.370
I had a dream about Lee-Leng.

00:07:14.200 --> 00:07:16.000
A bad dream?

00:07:16.000 --> 00:07:18.000
I can't remember now.

00:07:18.000 --> 00:07:21.300
But I don't think it was a pleasant one.

00:07:21.800 --> 00:07:25.880
My heart is still pounding. What if something's happened to him?

00:07:26.450 --> 00:07:29.000
Since everything he does is perfectly planned,

00:07:29.000 --> 00:07:31.000
what's there to worry about?

00:07:31.250 --> 00:07:35.300
Mustafa, you don't understand him!

00:07:36.450 --> 00:07:39.000
He's always had a reckless side.

00:07:39.350 --> 00:07:43.000
He keeps it in check for the sake of his family,

00:07:43.000 --> 00:07:46.000
but it's still enough to be frightened.

00:07:46.000 --> 00:07:48.020
Someday he'll just let go...

00:07:48.250 --> 00:07:53.000
But he'll push himself to the very limit first.

00:07:54.000 --> 00:07:58.000
People like that need a safe place.

00:07:58.000 --> 00:08:01.000
to let off some steam, show some emotion.

00:08:01.000 --> 00:08:03.040
You, for instance.

00:08:03.040 --> 00:08:04.790
Me?

00:08:05.000 --> 00:08:07.000
Prince Rumaty, for instance.

00:08:07.000 --> 00:08:11.000
You all defy common sense.

00:08:11.000 --> 00:08:13.800
You're saying I have no common sense?

00:08:14.000 --> 00:08:17.000
I'm saying it doesn't apply to you!

00:08:17.300 --> 00:08:19.300
It's a compliment.

00:08:23.750 --> 00:08:26.000
Well, go back to sleep for a bit.

00:08:26.000 --> 00:08:29.000
The party isn't for a while.

00:08:29.000 --> 00:08:32.000
Besides, you can't meet Najayra sleep-deprived, you'd be overwhelmed.

00:08:32.000 --> 00:08:36.320
Overwhelmed? You really think so?

00:08:36.800 --> 00:08:39.000
We'll find out soon enough.

00:08:39.000 --> 00:08:41.300
'Night, Kajika.

00:08:42.800 --> 00:08:46.080
Aren't you sleeping, Mustafa?

00:08:46.480 --> 00:08:49.090
I'll sleep if you do.

00:08:49.090 --> 00:08:52.000
I'll sleep then. Even, so...

00:08:52.000 --> 00:08:55.300
you never get enough sleep.

00:08:55.800 --> 00:08:58.000
They say it ages you prematurely!

00:08:58.250 --> 00:09:00.000
Wouldn't that be nice?

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:04.000
I can't wait to run around as a wrinkly old grandpa that nobody likes.

00:09:04.250 --> 00:09:06.000
Huh?

00:09:06.000 --> 00:09:09.300
If you want to put that off, go to sleep.

00:09:13.950 --> 00:09:16.300
What a threat!

00:09:23.800 --> 00:09:29.000
I'm sure I only had that dream because I wanted to see Lee-Leng.

00:09:29.450 --> 00:09:34.000
Whatever I may say, I really do rely on him.

00:09:34.000 --> 00:09:36.300
...like a child.

00:09:41.010 --> 00:09:43.300
There's the signal. Let's go.

00:09:44.020 --> 00:09:46.000
Linus. Linus!

00:09:46.700 --> 00:09:48.000
What is it?

00:09:48.000 --> 00:09:51.000
He's gone into shock from the bleeding.

00:09:51.000 --> 00:09:55.000
Jeez. What can I do with a dead guard?

00:09:55.000 --> 00:09:57.000
Useless!

00:09:57.450 --> 00:10:01.410
I'll take Young Master Huang here along.

00:10:02.150 --> 00:10:05.040
Can't leave our precious pearl alone, can we?

00:10:05.960 --> 00:10:08.300
Hey! Grab that one.

00:10:08.920 --> 00:10:10.300
Yes, sir.

00:10:18.500 --> 00:10:21.900
Hey. What you said before, were you for real?

00:10:21.900 --> 00:10:23.850
About the ransom money?

00:10:23.900 --> 00:10:24.380
Yea.

00:10:24.450 --> 00:10:28.300
Like I said. Two people, 300 hundred million.

00:10:30.800 --> 00:10:35.070
How can a prince from such a tiny country be worth so much?

00:10:35.400 --> 00:10:37.300
Perhaps you don't know.

00:10:37.800 --> 00:10:42.300
Raginei has the largest oil yield in all of Asia.

00:10:44.300 --> 00:10:46.200
Understand?

00:10:47.550 --> 00:10:50.300
Come on, move it!

00:10:56.450 --> 00:10:59.000
If Prince Rumaty takes the throne,

00:10:59.000 --> 00:11:03.000
we'll have a crude oil monopoly.

00:11:03.300 --> 00:11:08.000
How much money do you think we can move with one pipeline?

00:11:08.050 --> 00:11:08.650
Hmm...

00:11:08.750 --> 00:11:11.200
Billions of dollars!

00:11:14.650 --> 00:11:18.000
But what's more, I'm head of the Huang Group.

00:11:18.000 --> 00:11:22.000
Acting in haste would reflect badly on me.

00:11:22.350 --> 00:11:25.300
Our social standing would take a dive,

00:11:26.800 --> 00:11:31.000
and the stock price would plummet with it.

00:11:31.000 --> 00:11:33.000
So if you think about it,

00:11:33.000 --> 00:11:35.000
a little hush money would be a bargain for me.

00:11:35.750 --> 00:11:37.300
Make your choice!

00:11:38.000 --> 00:11:40.000
This is your only chance!

00:11:40.000 --> 00:11:45.000
Will you spend your whole life as a lackey and a criminal?

00:11:45.000 --> 00:11:49.300
Or as a man rich beyond measure?

00:11:52.700 --> 00:11:55.000
Three hundred million dollars.

00:11:55.000 --> 00:11:58.300
Enough to buy a new life.

00:12:01.050 --> 00:12:03.000
What are you doing, Brian?

00:12:03.000 --> 00:12:04.030
Hurry!

00:12:04.030 --> 00:12:07.300
Right! We're coming!

00:12:19.800 --> 00:12:25.000
As soon as we deliver you two, this job is over.

00:12:25.400 --> 00:12:31.300
Heh. I can finally drop the whole 'manners' act.

00:12:35.100 --> 00:12:38.000
Clearly, this guy is the old pro.

00:12:38.250 --> 00:12:44.000
Nothing I say to him is going to do any good.

00:12:44.500 --> 00:12:47.300
The other one, though...

00:12:54.800 --> 00:12:58.000
Boss, is this really a good idea?

00:12:58.450 --> 00:13:00.000
What do you mean?

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:03.000
If we hand the Prince over to Raginei now,

00:13:03.000 --> 00:13:05.000
we only get 100,000 dollars.

00:13:05.000 --> 00:13:08.000
But think--300 million...

00:13:08.000 --> 00:13:10.300
Hah. Cool down!

00:13:10.800 --> 00:13:14.300
We're in no danger from the smooth-talker.

00:13:14.800 --> 00:13:18.100
Right, exactly.

00:13:40.800 --> 00:13:42.800
Hey, what happened?

00:13:43.000 --> 00:13:45.300
Don't move!

00:13:45.800 --> 00:13:49.300
Brian, what the hell are you doing?

00:14:00.800 --> 00:14:03.000
Huh? They stopped.

00:14:03.000 --> 00:14:04.000
Was there an accident?

00:14:04.350 --> 00:14:06.190
Hit the lights!

00:14:06.190 --> 00:14:08.000
Please, don't blame me.

00:14:08.000 --> 00:14:11.000
I just really want 300 million dollars.

00:14:11.550 --> 00:14:15.200
I can't do this anymore.

00:14:15.800 --> 00:14:19.000
You think you can get away with this?

00:14:19.200 --> 00:14:23.000
Nowadays it's easy to become someone else.

00:14:23.000 --> 00:14:25.000
All you need is money.

00:14:25.000 --> 00:14:28.300
Forgive me, Boss.

00:14:34.750 --> 00:14:37.300
Your Highness, now!

00:14:52.850 --> 00:14:54.300
D--Dammit!

00:14:58.750 --> 00:15:00.300
Lee-Leng!

00:15:06.150 --> 00:15:09.510
You spoiled brat!

00:15:12.000 --> 00:15:15.260
Hah, does that hurt?

00:15:17.250 --> 00:15:19.000
I hope so!

00:15:19.000 --> 00:15:22.000
I hope it burns!

00:15:22.000 --> 00:15:25.000
How dare you try to cheat me?

00:15:25.450 --> 00:15:30.000
You could still take the 100 million dollar offer.

00:15:30.350 --> 00:15:32.000
Shut up!

00:15:32.000 --> 00:15:35.300
I'm not falling for that again!

00:15:46.050 --> 00:15:47.300
D--Damn.

00:15:52.200 --> 00:15:54.300
Master Lee-Leng!

00:15:55.800 --> 00:15:58.060
Just in time.

00:15:58.060 --> 00:16:03.000
The Prince is somewhere nearby. Hurry!

00:16:03.000 --> 00:16:04.300
Understood!

00:16:06.450 --> 00:16:09.300
Prince...

00:16:10.800 --> 00:16:13.000
D--Damn it all.

00:16:13.000 --> 00:16:16.000
A liar and a cheat.

00:16:16.000 --> 00:16:22.300
I'll remember your face, a demon's face.

00:16:22.710 --> 00:16:27.000
I'm no demon. I just whispered in your ear.

00:16:27.000 --> 00:16:31.970
The only demon here was your own, and its name was Greed.

00:16:31.970 --> 00:16:38.300
I--Idiot. That's... what a demon does...

00:16:47.860 --> 00:16:50.000
Master Lee-Leng, you're hurt--

00:16:50.000 --> 00:16:54.000
I'm fine, it went clean through. And the Prince?

00:16:54.000 --> 00:16:57.300
Don't worry. The other boat rescued him.

00:16:57.870 --> 00:16:59.000
Good.

00:16:59.550 --> 00:17:02.000
Wait, he's still breathing! Get the stretcher!

00:17:02.000 --> 00:17:05.120
There's one more floating out there!

00:17:14.700 --> 00:17:16.000
Ernest? How is he?

00:17:16.900 --> 00:17:18.000
I'm sorry.

00:17:18.800 --> 00:17:20.470
I see.

00:17:22.100 --> 00:17:23.000
His family?

00:17:23.200 --> 00:17:26.300
They called a few minutes ago.

00:17:41.750 --> 00:17:46.000
Your Highness. The important thing is that you're safe.

00:17:46.900 --> 00:17:49.000
Who is that lying there?

00:17:49.000 --> 00:17:53.250
Is it your bodyguard, the one they killed?

00:17:54.400 --> 00:17:55.000
Yes.

00:17:55.400 --> 00:17:59.300
It was my fault. I pushed him too hard.

00:18:00.550 --> 00:18:02.000
And John?

00:18:02.000 --> 00:18:04.300
What happened after they shot at his car?

00:18:04.800 --> 00:18:08.300
He was badly injured, but it's not critical.

00:18:08.800 --> 00:18:12.000
He can leave the hospital in 2 or 3 months.

00:18:12.000 --> 00:18:15.150
Well, let's get you changed. You'll catch a cold.

00:18:16.900 --> 00:18:20.000
Why didn't you leave me alone?

00:18:20.000 --> 00:18:24.410
I can't do any of the things Burnsworth wants!

00:18:25.350 --> 00:18:27.000
Prince...

00:18:27.000 --> 00:18:30.000
Protecting me with their lives?

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:32.420
It's too high a price!

00:18:35.920 --> 00:18:37.300
Come here!

00:18:38.450 --> 00:18:40.300
Master Lee-Leng!

00:18:40.800 --> 00:18:44.430
Gimme a minute. Everyone stay back!

00:18:45.050 --> 00:18:46.300
Yes, sir.

00:19:05.200 --> 00:19:08.000
Does that hurt? It should!

00:19:08.000 --> 00:19:09.960
It's the proof you're alive.

00:19:10.250 --> 00:19:13.300
Ernest will never feel pain again!

00:19:17.050 --> 00:19:21.300
He was killed... because of us!

00:19:23.300 --> 00:19:26.450
Your reckless conduct put him there,

00:19:27.300 --> 00:19:30.000
and my impossible plan finished him!

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:33.000
Wounds of the body eventually heal.

00:19:33.300 --> 00:19:37.000
But this pain will stay with me always.

00:19:37.450 --> 00:19:40.000
You have to carry that burden, too.

00:19:40.550 --> 00:19:44.300
And you have to be aware of your own foolishness!

00:19:44.800 --> 00:19:48.000
Understand your position, as well as your status:

00:19:48.550 --> 00:19:51.450
an idiot child!

00:19:51.500 --> 00:19:54.300
So Burnsworth is going to use you?

00:19:54.650 --> 00:19:58.000
If that's what Harry wants, you'd be wise to agree!

00:19:58.250 --> 00:20:02.000
Sheltering you at all has been an act of pure kindness.

00:20:02.650 --> 00:20:06.000
What does he care about Raginei?

00:20:06.000 --> 00:20:09.000
It would hardly matter to him if it didn't exist!

00:20:09.400 --> 00:20:12.300
But... the oil...

00:20:13.200 --> 00:20:16.300
How much longer do you think that will last?

00:20:17.380 --> 00:20:19.000
Maybe 30 years?

00:20:19.000 --> 00:20:21.300
And if you're not so lucky?

00:20:22.150 --> 00:20:24.500
And yet, the royal feuds continue...

00:20:25.000 --> 00:20:27.000
Raginei stands at a crossroad.

00:20:28.000 --> 00:20:30.000
Don't you get it?

00:20:31.550 --> 00:20:33.000
If you don't do something now,

00:20:33.000 --> 00:20:36.000
the country will slide right back into poverty.

00:20:36.950 --> 00:20:40.000
The people of your country today have never known want.

00:20:40.100 --> 00:20:42.650
Do you think they can bear it now?

00:20:43.100 --> 00:20:47.000
Without a doubt, anger will turn towards the royal family.

00:20:47.000 --> 00:20:48.800
There will be civil unrest.

00:20:49.800 --> 00:20:56.000
If it descends into chaos, how long can you hide it from the international community?

00:20:56.550 --> 00:20:59.000
If all this came to pass,

00:20:59.450 --> 00:21:05.300
Within ten years, the Kingdom of Raginei could disappear.

00:21:10.100 --> 00:21:13.000
The throne Somand is so eager to defend?

00:21:13.300 --> 00:21:16.000
If that happened, it would mean nothing.

00:21:16.000 --> 00:21:20.300
What Raginei needs now is a strong leader!

00:21:20.800 --> 00:21:24.340
A charismatic, capable person.

00:21:24.800 --> 00:21:29.000
The person who fits that description is you!

00:21:29.850 --> 00:21:32.000
I can't stand it anymore,

00:21:32.000 --> 00:21:36.000
watching you pretend not to see your potential!

00:21:36.300 --> 00:21:40.000
I don't know what you're talking about!

00:21:40.250 --> 00:21:42.110
I'm not aware of anything like that,

00:21:42.350 --> 00:21:45.000
and I don't want anything like that!

00:21:45.900 --> 00:21:51.000
I don't want the potential, or the throne.

00:21:51.550 --> 00:21:54.300
I don't want it!

00:21:55.580 --> 00:21:57.000
Why...

00:21:57.250 --> 00:22:00.000
why has my brother never spoken to me?

00:22:00.000 --> 00:22:03.300
Not even to tell me to die!

00:22:07.300 --> 00:22:08.000
If he did...

00:22:08.000 --> 00:22:10.000
If he did...

00:22:10.400 --> 00:22:13.300
I'd...

00:22:30.100 --> 00:22:42.000
Brother... just one word...

00:22:42.250 --> 00:22:47.420
I'd be happy, even if I lost my life.

00:22:47.800 --> 00:22:52.300
Brother... my brother....

00:22:55.250 --> 00:22:59.000
Brother!

00:23:00.940 --> 00:23:08.000
I can't stand feeling this distance,

00:23:08.000 --> 00:23:16.000
So I'm starting to search for your heart.

00:23:16.000 --> 00:23:23.000
Because you were always at my side, protecting me.

00:23:23.000 --> 00:23:28.300
And I'm afraid of being alone.

00:23:28.800 --> 00:23:37.000
Though it's been a long time, everyone's just the same.

00:23:37.000 --> 00:23:45.000
Whether sleeping now, or crying, I want to see your smiling face.

00:23:45.000 --> 00:23:52.000
Because I will love you, with heart overflowing.

00:23:52.000 --> 00:23:59.000
Don't turn away, look at me. I believe in you.

00:23:59.000 --> 00:24:06.920
So, no one else knows our secret thoughts

00:24:06.920 --> 00:24:14.000
The blue sea of a strong and beautiful time.

00:24:14.000 --> 00:24:21.300
In those arms, in that embrace, I'm alive.
